#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
msgid "Maps"
msgstr "Zemljevidi"

#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
msgid "Show where the companies are on a map, placing each postal address offline at its postcode or its town from tables kept on this server, or where you put it by hand; a contact's address and your own are drawn only when you ask, and their points are kept with them and erased with them. The map is drawn by Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) over OpenStreetMap's tiles (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL) unless Settings chooses other tiles or none; OpenStreetMap then learns each viewer's address and the area they look at. Places come from GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; its postal codes CC BY 4.0), the country names from the Unicode CLDR through Babel, and the world outline from Natural Earth (public domain). Switched off, there is no map page and no address is placed; the coordinates already stored stay recorded and come back untouched when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Prikažite lokacije podjetij na zemljevidu: vsak poštni naslov se brez povezave postavi na njegovo poštno številko ali kraj po tabelah, shranjenih na tem strežniku, ali tja, kamor ga postavite ročno; naslov stika in vaš lastni naslov sta prikazana le, če to zahtevate, njune točke pa se hranijo in izbrišejo skupaj z njima. Zemljevid izriše Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) na ploščicah OpenStreetMap (© sodelavci OpenStreetMap, ODbL), razen če so v Nastavitvah izbrane druge ploščice ali nobene; OpenStreetMap tako izve naslov vsakega gledalca in območje, ki si ga ogleduje. Kraji so iz GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; poštne številke CC BY 4.0), imena držav iz Unicode CLDR prek Babel, obris sveta pa iz Natural Earth (javna last). Ko je izklopljeno, strani z zemljevidom ni in noben naslov se ne postavi; že shranjene koordinate ostanejo zabeležene in se nedotaknjene vrnejo, ko ga znova vklopite."
